;\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003ESP \u00fcgysz\u00e1m: SP\/1073-2\/2026\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u0026nbsp;\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u0026nbsp;\u003C\/p\u003E","format":"full_html","processed":"\u003Cp\u003EAz Alapt\u00f6rv\u00e9ny 9.\u0026nbsp;cikk (4)\u0026nbsp;bekezd\u00e9s b)\u0026nbsp;pontja alapj\u00e1n \u2013 a\u0026nbsp;k\u00fclgazdas\u00e1gi \u00e9s k\u00fcl\u00fcgyminiszter el\u0151terjeszt\u00e9s\u00e9re \u2013 hozz\u00e1j\u00e1rulok \u003Cem\u003EJana Vanam\u00f6lder\u003C\/em\u003E rendk\u00edv\u00fcli \u00e9s meghatalmazott nagyk\u00f6vetnek az\u0026nbsp;\u00c9szt K\u00f6zt\u00e1rsas\u00e1g magyarorsz\u00e1gi rendk\u00edv\u00fcli \u00e9s meghatalmazott nagyk\u00f6vet\u00e9v\u00e9 t\u00f6rt\u00e9n\u0151 kinevez\u00e9s\u00e9hez, budapesti sz\u00e9khellyel.\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u0026nbsp;\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESP \u00fcgysz\u00e1m: SP\/1073-2\/2026\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u0026nbsp;\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u0026nbsp;\u003C\/p\u003E\n","summary":""},"field_ai_summary":{"value":"\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EA Hat\u00e1rozat hozz\u00e1j\u00e1rul Jana Vanam\u00f6lder kinevez\u00e9s\u00e9hez\u003C\/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EJana Vanam\u00f6lder az \u00c9szt K\u00f6zt\u00e1rsas\u00e1g rendk\u00edv\u00fcli \u00e9s meghatalmazott nagyk\u00f6vete lesz Magyarorsz\u00e1gon\u003C\/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EA nagyk\u00f6vet sz\u00e9khelye Budapest\u003C\/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EA d\u00f6nt\u00e9s a k\u00fclgazdas\u00e1gi \u00e9s k\u00fcl\u00fcgyminiszter el\u0151terjeszt\u00e9se alapj\u00e1n sz\u00fcletett\u003C\/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u00dcgysz\u00e1m: SP\/1073-2\/2026\u003C\/li\u003E\n\u003C\/ul\u003E\n","format":"full_html","processed":"\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EA Hat\u00e1rozat hozz\u00e1j\u00e1rul Jana Vanam\u00f6lder kinevez\u00e9s\u00e9hez\u003C\/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EJana Vanam\u00f6lder az \u00c9szt K\u00f6zt\u00e1rsas\u00e1g rendk\u00edv\u00fcli \u00e9s meghatalmazott nagyk\u00f6vete lesz Magyarorsz\u00e1gon\u003C\/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EA nagyk\u00f6vet sz\u00e9khelye Budapest\u003C\/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EA d\u00f6nt\u00e9s a k\u00fclgazdas\u00e1gi \u00e9s k\u00fcl\u00fcgyminiszter el\u0151terjeszt\u00e9se alapj\u00e1n sz\u00fcletett\u003C\/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u00dcgysz\u00e1m: SP\/1073-2\/2026\u003C\/li\u003E\n\u003C\/ul\u003E\n"},"field_correction":false,"field_njt_url":null,"field_page_number":4,"field_regulation_number":"247\/2026. (X. 5.) KE hat\u00e1rozat","field_regulation_title":"Magyarorsz\u00e1gi rendk\u00edv\u00fcli \u00e9s meghatalmazott nagyk\u00f6vet kinevez\u00e9s\u00e9hez val\u00f3 hozz\u00e1j\u00e1rul\u00e1sr\u00f3l","field_synonym":"recept\ngazdi"},"relationships":{"node_type":{"data":{"type":"node_type--node_type","id":"2de4f0c4-1ed1-4766-9521-6ae4441af5d5","meta":{"drupal_internal__target_id":"issue_unit"}},"links":{"related":{"href":"https:\/\/jog.gov.hu:80\/jsonapi\/node\/issue_unit\/a9f4037d-82fb-4aec-9a9e-d84fa2d6ac18\/node_type?resourceVersion=id%3A218057"},"self":{"href":"https:\/\/jog.gov.hu:80\/jsonapi\/node\/issue_unit\/a9f4037d-82fb-4aec-9a9e-d84fa2d6ac18\/relationships\/node_type?resourceVersion=id%3A218057"}}},"revision_uid":{"data":{"type":"user--user","id":"88687bb7-61de-4013-a5bd-0bddeed53e90","meta":{"drupal_internal__target_id":38}},"links":{"related":{"href":"https:\/\/jog.gov.hu:80\/jsonapi\/node\/issue_unit\/a9f4037d-82fb-4aec-9a9e-d84fa2d6ac18\/revision_uid?resourceVersion=id%3A218057"},"self":{"href":"https:\/\/jog.gov.hu:80\/jsonapi\/node\/issue_unit\/a9f4037d-82fb-4aec-9a9e-d84fa2d6ac18\/relationships\/revision_uid?resourceVersion=id%3A218057"}}},"uid":{"data":{"type":"user--user","id":"92b0ac2c-ebb9-43b5-a02d-d1306c70a5dd","meta":{"drupal_internal__target_id":39}},"links":{"related":{"href":"https:\/\/jog.gov.hu:80\/jsonapi\/node\/issue_unit\/a9f4037d-82fb-4aec-9a9e-d84fa2d6ac18\/uid?resourceVersion=id%3A218057"},"self":{"href":"https:\/\/jog.gov.hu:80\/jsonapi\/node\/issue_unit\/a9f4037d-82fb-4aec-9a9e-d84fa2d6ac18\/relationships\